<title>USA: MICROS Systems Inc Q3 March 31 shr rises.</title>
<headline>MICROS Systems Inc Q3 March 31 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>BELTSVILLE, Md. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.55   profit	  0.15</p>
<p> Net profit		 4,464   profit	 1,182</p>
<p> Revs			56,710		   47,305</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,169		    8,040</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $1.34     loss	 $0.08</p>
<p> Net profit		10,802     loss	   652</p>
<p> Revs		     160,183		  122,553</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,035		    8,014</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Prior year results include a one-time, after-tax charge of $8.1 million, or $1.01 per share, for purchased in-development software technology associated with MICROS' acquisition of Fidelio Software GmbH in November 1995.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
